 Here is what will change                                                in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 In C:\Projects\quiz-slayer and every folder inside it, Claude Code will use default
 (you@personal.example).
 The rest of C:\Projects stays work (you@work.example).
 Everywhere else stays default (you@personal.example).

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (adds)
     [[rule]]
     folder = 'C:\Projects\quiz-slayer'
     claude = "default"

